# Bridges and Boards: seesaws tip under any ball; plate bridges hold the wooden and paper balls but break under the
# stone one. Edit this file and run `python3 -I assets/own/make/leveldsl.py <this file>`.
title Bridges and Boards
title.ru Мосты и доски
title.de Brücken und Bretter
title.zh 桥与板
order 5
sky B
music 5
bonus 500
ball wood
columns 45

start
width 12
floor 30
seesaw
floor 20
point
left 90 24
floor 20
seesaw
floor 20
checkpoint

# sector 2: stone over a seesaw, wood again before the plate bridge
floor 15
trafo stone
floor 20
seesaw
floor 15
right 90 24
floor 25 down 4
floor 10
trafo wood
floor 15
platebridge
floor 20
checkpoint

# sector 3: narrower, two plate bridges and a seesaw
floor 15
width 10
floor 15
platebridge
floor 10
left 90 20
floor 10
point
floor 10
platebridge
floor 15
life
floor 10
seesaw
floor 20
checkpoint

# sector 4: paper: a plate bridge, a fan up, a seesaw
floor 15
trafo paper
floor 20
platebridge
floor 15
right 90 22
floor 20
fan ahead -5
gap 4 up 12 nopilot
floor 20
seesaw
floor 15
trafo wood
floor 15
checkpoint

# sector 5: wood: a last seesaw, rails, the finish
floor 15
seesaw
floor 15
left 90 24
floor 10
rails 30
floor 15
point
floor 30
finish
